{
  "id": "lesson_photosynthesis_continuous",
  "topic": "Photosynthesis: How Plants Make Food",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "step_1_intro",
      "narration": "Inside every green plant, the leaf [leaf] serves as a microscopic solar-powered factory.",
      "ops": [
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "leaf",
          "element": {
            "id": "leaf",
            "type": "shape",
            "shapeType": "ellipse",
            "size": "lg",
            "placement": {
              "type": "root",
              "x": 500,
              "y": 260
            },
            "label": "Leaf (Chloroplast)",
            "color": "success"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "step_2_sunlight",
      "narration": "To start the reaction, sunlight [sun] beams energy down directly into the chloroplasts.",
      "ops": [
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "sun",
          "element": {
            "id": "sun",
            "type": "shape",
            "shapeType": "circle",
            "size": "sm",
            "placement": {
              "type": "relative",
              "relativeTo": "leaf",
              "position": "above-left",
              "offset": "lg"
            },
            "label": "Sun",
            "color": "warn"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "sun",
          "element": {
            "id": "conn_sun_leaf",
            "type": "connector",
            "from": "sun",
            "to": "leaf",
            "label": "Light Energy",
            "color": "warn"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "step_3_raw_materials",
      "narration": "Next, the plant draws in carbon dioxide [co2] from the air, and water [h2o] up through its roots [roots_absorb].",
      "ops": [
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "co2",
          "element": {
            "id": "co2_in",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "CO₂ (from air)",
            "size": "sm",
            "placement": {
              "type": "relative",
              "relativeTo": "leaf",
              "position": "left",
              "offset": "md"
            },
            "color": "default"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "co2",
          "element": {
            "id": "conn_co2_leaf",
            "type": "connector",
            "from": "co2_in",
            "to": "leaf",
            "color": "default"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "h2o",
          "element": {
            "id": "h2o_in",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "H₂O (from roots)",
            "size": "sm",
            "placement": {
              "type": "relative",
              "relativeTo": "leaf",
              "position": "below",
              "offset": "md"
            },
            "color": "accent"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "h2o",
          "element": {
            "id": "conn_h2o_leaf",
            "type": "connector",
            "from": "h2o_in",
            "to": "leaf",
            "color": "accent"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "CIRCLE",
          "anchor": "roots_absorb",
          "targetId": "leaf",
          "color": "success"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "step_4_products_and_correction",
      "narration": "Some believe soil provides the calories [soil_myth], but that's a misconception [strike_myth]. We can clear that away [clear_myth]. The true products are glucose [glucose] and vital oxygen [oxygen].",
      "ops": [
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "soil_myth",
          "element": {
            "id": "soil_note",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Soil provides food?",
            "size": "sm",
            "placement": {
              "type": "relative",
              "relativeTo": "leaf",
              "position": "above-right",
              "offset": "md"
            },
            "color": "muted"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "STRIKE",
          "anchor": "strike_myth",
          "targetId": "soil_note"
        },
        {
          "op": "ERASE",
          "anchor": "clear_myth",
          "targetIds": ["soil_note"]
        },
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "glucose",
          "element": {
            "id": "glucose_out",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Glucose (Sugar)",
            "size": "md",
            "placement": {
              "type": "relative",
              "relativeTo": "leaf",
              "position": "above-right",
              "offset": "md"
            },
            "color": "success"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "glucose",
          "element": {
            "id": "conn_leaf_glucose",
            "type": "connector",
            "from": "leaf",
            "to": "glucose_out",
            "color": "success"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "oxygen",
          "element": {
            "id": "o2_out",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "O₂ (Oxygen gas)",
            "size": "sm",
            "placement": {
              "type": "relative",
              "relativeTo": "leaf",
              "position": "right",
              "offset": "md"
            },
            "color": "accent"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "oxygen",
          "element": {
            "id": "conn_leaf_o2",
            "type": "connector",
            "from": "leaf",
            "to": "o2_out",
            "color": "accent"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "step_5_equation_summary",
      "narration": "To summarize the chemical transformation [equation], we write the overall reaction, and balance the stoichiometry [balanced].",
      "ops": [
        {
          "op": "DIM",
          "anchor": "equation",
          "targetIds": ["sun", "co2_in", "h2o_in"]
        },
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "equation",
          "element": {
            "id": "eq_word",
            "type": "latex",
            "math": "\\text{Light} + 6\\text{CO}_2 + 6\\text{H}_2\\text{O} = \\text{C}_6\\text{H}_{12}\\text{O}_6 + 6\\text{O}_2",
            "size": "md",
            "placement": {
              "type": "root"
            },
            "color": "default"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "DRAW",
          "anchor": "balanced",
          "element": {
            "id": "eq_chemical",
            "type": "latex",
            "math": "6\\text{CO}_2 + 6\\text{H}_2\\text{O} \\xrightarrow{h\\nu} \\text{C}_6\\text{H}_{12}\\text{O}_6 + 6\\text{O}_2",
            "size": "md",
            "placement": {
              "type": "relative",
              "relativeTo": "eq_word",
              "position": "below-aligned-eq",
              "offset": "sm"
            },
            "color": "accent"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "UNDERLINE",
          "anchor": "balanced",
          "targetId": "eq_chemical",
          "color": "accent"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

